# An issue is polled over HTTP rather than through `gh`, so its failure carries
# a real network error, which can be long. The status line has to keep the part
# that says watching goes on.

size 110x30
arg --mux
fake_gh
session app Waiting on a reply
# Nothing listens on port 9, so the poll is refused.
watch_thread https://127.0.0.1:9/o/r/issues/1
timeout 150000

wait_for Thread watching will keep retrying
dump 01-refused-connection
